# VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio .http file.
# Use the bootstrap admin configured via user-secrets (see README).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@email = admin@example.com
@password = change-me

### Health (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Validation error (400 ProblemDetails)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": ""
}
